{"title":"1989 USAMO Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_USAMO_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>For each positive <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Integer\" title=\"Integer\">integer</a> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" />, let\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/0/2/202dd6e8e3607a2feb8e9dcfd8a09e6834c50498.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} S_n &amp;= 1 + \\frac 12 + \\frac 13 + \\cdots + \\frac 1n \\\\ T_n &amp;= S_1 + S_2 + S_3 + \\cdots + S_n \\\\ U_n &amp;= \\frac{T_1}{2} + \\frac{T_2}{3} + \\frac{T_3}{4} + \\cdots + \\frac{T_n}{n+1}. \\end{align*}\" width=\"270\" height=\"109\" />\nFind, with proof, integers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/9/8996c96b5bf370e21a81278b54c6203ee3a1be0f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0 &lt; a,\\ b,\\ c,\\ d &lt; 1000000$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"195\" height=\"16\" /> such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/2/8/228208e58ea267d5895c1cd7918fe843ba31dbe0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$T_{1988} = a S_{1989} - b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"140\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/5/c/55c002ecdd604508bef322f223fffd5db3d89d6f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$U_{1988} = c S_{1989} - d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"142\" height=\"15\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_USAMO_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We note that for all integers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/1/7/317096889b84df0b72bf69ceb4c82208305f1b0f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n \\ge 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"46\" height=\"16\" />,\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/7/1/f71adc4da600589098a9ada022cc754dd5dd0d66.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} T_{n-1} &amp;= 1 + \\left(1 + \\frac 12\\right) + \\left(1 + \\frac 12 + \\frac 13\\right) + \\ldots + \\left(1 + \\frac 12 + \\frac 13 + \\ldots + \\frac 1{n-1}\\right) \\\\  &amp;= \\sum_{i=1}^{n-1} \\left(\\frac {n-i}i\\right) = n\\left(\\sum_{i=1}^{n-1} \\frac{1}{i}\\right) - (n-1) = n\\left(\\sum_{i=1}^{n} \\frac{1}{i}\\right) - n \\\\ &amp;= n \\cdot S_{n} - n .  \\end{align*}\" width=\"570\" height=\"126\" />\n</p><p>It then follows that\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c9026af66636a640e2104a464002a9209ca453.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} U_{n-1} &amp;= \\sum_{i=2}^{n} \\frac{T_{i-1}}{i} = \\sum_{i=2}^{n}\\ (S_{i} - 1) = T_{n-1} + S_n - (n-1) - S_1 \\\\ &amp;= \\left(nS_n - n\\right) + S_n - n = (n + 1)S_n - 2n . \\end{align*}\" width=\"465\" height=\"74\" />\n</p><p>If we let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/b/1/db15f0dbd3792a1a5d77f939587eb2e00a4adbd4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n=1989$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"70\" height=\"13\" />, we see that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/9/d/49dca2376cffcccaedf0c46a0859335a3195e0f7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a,b,c,d) = (1989,1989,1990, 2\\cdot 1989)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"301\" height=\"18\" /> is a suitable solution.  <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/b/b/3bbb9e25e5be095e317771a9c5d00877ee9c8012.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\blacksquare$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p>Notice that it is also possible to use induction to prove the equations relating <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/2/f/82f4341a1efbe1a890de160de023b4e4b84ef444.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$T_n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"18\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/b/9fbf1a46d9e0cedde66ffbe8317d0cc7f06e04fd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$U_n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"20\" height=\"15\" /> with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/4/c74a070eea97d9363f58a257e05e75fc69efa753.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S_n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"22\" height=\"17\" />.\n</p><p><br />\n<i>Alternate solutions are always welcome. If you have a different, elegant solution to this problem, please <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=1989_USAMO_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit\">add it</a> to this page.</i>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_USAMO_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:40%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_USAMO\" title=\"1989 USAMO\">1989 USAMO</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_USAMO_Problems\" title=\"1989 USAMO Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=27&amp;year=1989\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b>First question</b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_USAMO_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1989 USAMO Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_USAMO_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1989 USAMO Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_USAMO_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1989 USAMO Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_USAMO_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1989 USAMO Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_USAMO_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1989 USAMO Problems/Problem 5\">5</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=USAMO_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"USAMO Problems and Solutions\"> All USAMO Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<ul><li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/viewtopic.php?p=356633#p356633\">Discussion on AoPS/MathLinks</a></li></ul>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017181714\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time 